CodeSystem: NewbornSignsOfLifeCS
Id: newborn-signs-of-life-cs
Title: "Form097 Newborn Signs of Life"
Description: "Local codes for the newborn signs of life recorded at birth (Form097 birth event). Created because no exact active SNOMED CT concept is available for these 'presence of ...' observations; pending CHR terminology agreement. CHR-0127 code group."

* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(newborn-signs-of-life-cs)

* #chr-0127-0001 "Nafas olish belgisi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Признак дыхания"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Presence of respiration"

* #chr-0127-0002 "Yurak urishi belgisi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Признак сердцебиения"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Presence of heartbeat"

* #chr-0127-0003 "Kindik tomiri pulsatsiyasi belgisi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Признак пульсации пуповины"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Presence of umbilical cord pulsation"

* #chr-0127-0004 "Ixtiyorsiz mushak qisqarishi belgisi"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Признак непроизвольного сокращения мышц"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
  * ^designation[=].value = "Presence of involuntary muscle movement"
